poiler":false,"text":"拥有顽强好胜的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和虎太郎是青梅竹马，在很久以前关系就很好。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在前几天前正式变成了恋人关系，关系仍是很纯洁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在学园担任学生会会长。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18772"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/dbaa45c0ccae346bc00e8ad1af3771cad943e6dda999dd3bc2dab2c3f869462d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a62c13b2b9d1f94fc33fd2ed6f383208471a7ce8e3e47a2d88b1703f9da7879.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"峰岸由香里","creatorId":"vndb:s925","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s925","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s925","name":"峰岸 由香里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:62675:18772:5939:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33545","characterName":"三上 真衣","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18773","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62675"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6811"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33545"},"originalCharacterName":"三上 真衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akira's twin sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33545"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"晶の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極度の人見知りで、前髪で目元を隠している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友人は少なく、特に男子学生においては、虎太郎以外とは会話をまともに交わした事も無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は虎太郎の事が好きなのだが、その気持ちを隠して晶と虎太郎の交際を見守っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目と雰囲気の地味さとは裏腹に、脱ぐとかなりグラマーな身体つきをしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6811","sourceWorkId":"17179","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"晶的妹妹。因为极度认生而用前发遮住眼睛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朋友很少，特别是男学生，除了虎太郎以外都没有说过话的对象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其实非常喜欢虎太郎，但隐瞒住感情注视着晶和虎太郎的交往。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和不起眼的外表和氛围相反，拥有超群的丰盈身材。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18773"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/896ea06626efbfe3fc1ca7523394237cce3539cac74c3c0ad54e0b8dfd2b0976.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f796f58f8ac3c3addf67500440a0a3168a2369c4743205c5e6653a2881481946.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朋永真季","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:62675:18773:6351:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33546","characterName":"須藤 カナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18774","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62675"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6812"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33546"},"originalCharacterName":"須藤 カナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"晶の親友で、真衣とも親しい間柄の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「～だぜ」などの男言葉を使い、その口調通りの男勝りな性格をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子ソフトボール部のエースピッチャーでサウスポー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舟木聡詞と交際中だが、虎太郎達と同様、こちらもプラトニックな関係。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりの貧乳である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6812","sourceWorkId":"17179","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"晶的朋友，和真衣关系也很好的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"使用「～だぜ」的男孩气的口调，拥有正如其口调般的假小子的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子垒球部的精英左手投手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为社团活动而身体被晒黑了，但其实皮肤很白。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和舟木聡詞正在交往，但和虎太郎他们一样，也是非常纯洁的关系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相当的贫乳。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18774"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8ca2c05145f61c96000b77eabee17f2090085926eee6f2e00c72f1f1d0a8e67c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7ca6d4c394e7b4ac36ce0cc31b5c5eec77535863397da9bf9dd569a8f77f2dd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"尾崎未來","creatorId":"vndb:s986","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s986","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s986","name":"尾崎 未來","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:62675:18774:13776:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33547","characterName":"日向 紗英奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18775","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62675"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6813"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33547"},"originalCharacterName":"日向 紗英奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akira and Mai step mother"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33547"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"虎太郎、晶の担任教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生真面目な性格で、何事に対しても厳しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、潔癖症でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生達からは、「無駄乳」（相手が居ないから）とあだ名されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実はバツイチで、子供もいるが親権は夫（資産家の家）に取られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は新たな婚約者がいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6813","sourceWorkId":"17179","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"虎太郎和晶的班主任教师。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格一本正经，对任何事情都很严格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同时也有洁癖症。被学生们取名为“无用巨乳（没有对象）”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其实有过离异经历，也有孩子但被拥有监护权的资产家丈夫给领走了。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"现在有了新的未婚夫。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18775"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34f44f40dcde4ed75835e9ed23316e91c7015b5aea2458d571dc69b0cd598ba4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e82a4aec173f6df8041bcca085be9a7e24dcd2f3c02858a5a3e5ba93f7b943ed.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:62675:18775:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c68258","characterName":"矢部 虎太郎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18776","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62675"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6814"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68258"},"originalCharacterName":"矢部 虎太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"マジメさが取り柄の、眼鏡をかけた男子学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人しくて優しい性格だが、悪く言えば気弱。しかも超がつくほどの気弱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生会執行部の書記をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（晶に強引に誘われる形で選挙に出馬させられた）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「でも‥‥」が口癖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の名前にコンプレックスがあり、「虎太郎」と呼ばれるのが好きではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため彼のことを晶は「こーちゃん」、真衣は「こー先輩」と呼んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6814","sourceWorkId":"17179","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"认真是其优点的戴眼镜的男学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格老实温和，说不好听点就是软弱。而且还是超级级别的软弱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「果然我还是不行啊」是其口癖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对和自己性格完全不符合的名字抱有情结。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18776"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/caaacc93f9ec9079c5f7f4db73dcd3f4635da35299b0b6af1ea7be5636688dd6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/17f350636e18ef4b22055ad7aa19f77784148cd26fd58740c27d2739a085b8e3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c68259","characterName":"一ノ瀬 智哉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18777","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62675"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6815"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68259"},"originalCharacterName":"一ノ瀬 智哉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"不良グループのリーダー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"肝が据わっており、悪事を働く時も悪びれる事がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人が苦しむ様を見る事を嗜好としている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素行の悪さを晶から注意されたのをきっかけに、面白半分に虎太郎の目の前で晶を寝取る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虎太郎や晶とは小学校の頃から同じ学校だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、顔なじみ程度で仲が良かったわけではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大柄な体格で、晶と並ぶと晶の小柄さがより目立つ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6815","sourceWorkId":"17179","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"不良小组的头头。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胆大包天，干坏事的时候也能毫不动容。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以看到其他人痛苦的样子当做自己的嗜好。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以因为品行恶劣遭到晶的注意为契机，一半是出于有趣地在虎太郎面前牛头人了晶。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"体格巨大，和晶站在一起更突出了晶的矮小。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18777"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d89d3c373350ad0ac2c9d0398071eb1040992f33cf39a88866dd463c30b6c71b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abaaf4fb78a0ccccfc9fd46ab7dd953e88341e02f510d306b1c1d9a05faa4e32.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"